Normally the polymorph wears off if you die in combat.
You'll revert to your original form.  Part of the danger is
you often aren't wearing your armor or whatever when
you revert so it's a very dangerous situation.  There's
no specific need to stay on your safe spot but staying
there until the polymorph wears off will be a lot safer.

